<title>SWEDEN: Sweden gives bank license to GE Capital Bank.</title>
<headline>Sweden gives bank license to GE Capital Bank.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden's finance department said on Thursday it had granted a banking license to GE Capital Bank AB, a unit of General Electric.  </p>
<p>&quot;The government decided today to grant permission to GE Capital Bank AB for banking operations,&quot; the finance department said in a statement.</p>
<p>GE Capital Bank is part of the U.S. General Electric group. The group has been running finance operations in Sweden, the department said.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1003</p>
